# Validation (default — never remove)

## Always

- Validate on the **server** for every write/auth endpoint — UI checks are not enough
- Mirror clear rules on the **client** for the unified form system (required, format, min/max)
- Show field-level errors with the shared error chrome from `forms.mdc`
- Reject empty required fields; validate email/tel/password/file constraints before submit when possible
- Return structured `4xx` with field paths when the API supports it
- Never trust hidden fields, disabled inputs, or client-only role flags

## Minimum checks by control

| Control | Default checks |
|---------|----------------|
| Email | Required (if marked) + format |
| Tel | Required (if marked) + allowed pattern |
| Password | Required (if marked) + min length (project policy) |
| Upload | Type allowlist + max size |
| Stepper / number | min, max, step |
| Select / checkbox | Required membership when marked |

Advanced (schemas, cross-field, async uniqueness): `validation-advanced.mdc`.
